  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "The last minor before 1.0: the published keys and classes are frozen in a file the tests hold the theme to, and `FiliFontSize` now sets the app's text size. Behaviour the templates had silently dropped works again (an editable select, a scroll bar's paging, a calendar from the keyboard, a switch's drag), a screen reader hears every icon button, upper-case label and validation error the theme draws, and reduced motion stops every transition. Keyboard focus now draws a ring in every variant. A few fields, grids and switches look slightly different, each listed under Upgrading.\n\nWhat changed, and how to upgrade: https://github.com/FiliArrochada/Fili.Theme.MudAvalonia/blob/6703b2da8d63e54b66b9e5306c22fda1a20ee89a/docs/versions/0.29.0.md",
